source: tui/src/onboarding/auth.rs
expression: "render_widget(&widget, 80, 18)"
---
  Sign in to UnieAI Studio to use UnieAI Code with your
  organization's models

  1. Sign in with UnieAI Studio
     Use your UnieAI account (studio.unieai.com)

  2. Sign in with your company's UnieAI Studio
     Enter your company or on-prem Studio URL

  3. Sign in with UnieAI Rabi
     Use your Rabi account (agent.unieai.com)

> 4. Use a self-hosted model server (vLLM, Ollama, LM Studio, …)
     Connect an OpenAI-compatible server you run; no account needed

  Press enter to continue
